 "transcript": [
  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung looks at his sons and then at Pear Blossom.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) The second son returns home.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"We are setting up a great store and we will make a great deal of money out of it.\"",
  "[silence] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung says nothing.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"We will sell out the lands and buy silver and gold and we will not be poor again,\"",
  "[action] Eldest son moves away from father with a mixture of anger and hatred",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) The second son leaves with his brother.",
  "Wang Lung: \"Well, and those are my sons and they are my flesh and blood and yet I do not know them and I do not love them and I am afraid of them.\"",
  "[action] Wang Lung goes to room and sits on bed",
  "[says] (to the second son) Eldest son invites brother to join family for meal",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"Well, and it is a good thing we have Pear Blossom to care for us and to do the cooking and to wait upon us. She is a good woman and she does well by us. It is a good thing we have her.\"",
  "[action] Wang Lung cries out about Pear Blossom.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Pear Blossom---Pear Blossom---\"",
  "Wang Lung: \"Well, and I have never heard of her crying out over young men in those days!\"",
  "[says] The eldest son denies his father's accusations.",
  "[says] (to Wang Lung) The eldest son denies his father's accusations.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"You were a young man and you had a young wife and it is a common thing that women cry out in their sleep.\"",
  "[action] The sons dismiss the subject.",
  "[action] The sons invite Pear Blossom to join them.",
  "[says] The sons speak with their father about a matter of business."
